2:T4b0,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover","headline":"Promo Voiceover - Patrick Stewart Style","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"A deadpan promo for a delightfully absurd game. Guy Harris channels Patrick Stewart with a twist of Matt Berry. Bold, funny, and unmistakably British.","datePublished":"2016-02-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2016-02-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["Patrick Stewart","Matt Berry"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover.jpg"}}3:T40d,<h2><strong>30K+ Views and Laughs All Round</strong></h2>
<p>The promo racked up over 30,000 views on YouTube via the game’s official channel, proving this offbeat blend of gravitas and comedy landed well with audiences.</p>
<p><a href="/https://realcast.io/htc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Hide the Corpse creators">Realcast</a> absolutely nailed the tone, and I'm grateful they trusted me to bring a little theatrical absurdity to the mic.</p>
<p>If you're after something similarly bold and British, check out other scripts I've voiced in this tone:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover">Minecraft Backpack – Stewart-style for gamers</a></li>
  <li><a href="/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart">NFL & CBS – Epic narration for King Henry</a></li>
  <li><a href="/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover">Lending Crowd – Confident, polished delivery</a></li>
</ul>7:["slug","hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover","d"]
