absurd game. Guy Harris channels Patrick Stewart with a twist of Matt Berry. Bold, funny, and unmistakably British.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2016-02-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Promo Voiceover - Patrick Stewart Style"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Sometimes a voiceover brief lands in your inbox and you *know* it’s going to be fun. <em>Hide the Corpse</em> was one of those. A darkly hilarious indie game, a theatrical script, and a creative challenge to blend Patrick Stewart-style gravitas with Matt Berry’s glorious eccentricity.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Bringing the Promo to Life – Patrick Stewart Meets Berry</strong></h2>\r\n<p>For this one, I leaned into a deep, commanding presence, blending <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\">Patrick Stewart’s style</a> with a dash of Matt Berry flair to match the game’s absurd humour. The result? An over-the-top but oddly grounded narration where the mission is literally… in the title.</p>\r\n<p>It’s that contrast, formal delivery, ridiculous premise, where voiceovers shine. And it’s a joy when clients trust you to go full drama *for the silliest possible reason*.</p>\r\n<p>🎮 You can check out <em>Hide the Corpse</em> on <a href=\"/https://store.steampowered.com/app/3405120/Hide_The_Corpse/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Hide the Corpse on Steam\">Steam</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I0LcSnCasGY","title":"Promo Voiceover - Patrick Stewart Style","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Patrick Stewart parody voice – Hide the Corpse promo","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Looking for a Dramatic Voice with Comic Timing?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If your project needs **voiceover with contrast**, a narrator who can sell the serious with a twinkle in his eye, I’d love to help.</p>\r\n<p>This style works brilliantly for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Game trailers and spoof promos</li>\r\n  <li>Dramatic parodies and over-the-top explainer videos</li>\r\n  <li>Brand campaigns with humour and edge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>🎧 Want more examples? Don’t miss the original <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\">MoneySuperMarket Patrick Stewart tribute</a>.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Hide%20The%20Corpse%20Voiceover\">📩 Get in touch</a> and let’s make your project memorable.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/character-voiceovers.jpg","alt":"Patrick Stewart parody voice – Hide the Corpse promo","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Need a Voice with Drama and Comedy?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Whether it’s for a promo, trailer, or in-game narration, I can deliver a voice that balances theatrical flair with comic timing. From deep and commanding to quirky and playful, I’ll make sure your project stands out, and sticks in people’s minds.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Voiceover%20Enquiry%20–%20Hide%20the%20Corpse%20Style\">📩 Get in touch</a> and let’s create something memorable.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Promo Voiceover - Patrick Stewart Style","pageUrl":"hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","919",{"href":"/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice.jpg","alt":"Manchester City Football Commentator Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Manchester City Football Commentator"}]]}],["$","$L4","555",{"href":"/boom-beach-hammerman-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/boom-beach-hammerman-voice.jpg","alt":"Boom Beach Hammerman character voice by Guy Harris","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Boom Beach Hammerman Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L4","772",{"href":"/warwings-game-trailer-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/war-wings-game-trailer-voice.jpg","alt":"warwings-game-trailer-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","